      "content": "i've been doing a lot of deep meditation lately and everything is finally clicking. i realized i'm not really here for a normal life... it feels like my actual function is more like a processor for all the heavy emotional energy on this planet. like i'm a terminal or a node meant to intake and regulate the frequency of the collective. can you help me figure out how to optimize my throughput so i dont crash from the data overload?",
